{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20833","headline":"雁门太守行 · 李贺","name":"雁门太守行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黑云压城城欲摧，甲光向日金鳞开。\n角声满天秋色里，塞上燕脂凝夜紫。\n半卷红旗临易水，霜重鼓寒声不起。\n报君黄金台上意，提携玉龙爲君死。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20833.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20833","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗·乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》卷三九〇、《唐诗鉴赏辞典》李贺条（上海辞书出版社，1983）、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"周啸天"}